{"seq":2,"slug":"error-handling","title":"错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/swift-concurrency/memory-safety/error-handling","wordCount":1180,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"错误处理\">错误处理</h1><p>把网络请求写成「成功返回数据，失败返回 nil」很诱人，但 nil 丢掉了失败的原因。Swift 的错误处理走另一条路：失败是一种显式的、带类型信息的控制流。函数用 <code>throws</code> 声明「我可能失败」，调用方用 <code>try</code> 标注「这里可能抛错」，用 <code>do/catch</code> 接住并按错误类型分别处理。这套设计和<a href=\"../language-core/types-optionals\">可选值</a>一脉相承——都把「可能出错」从隐患提升为类型层面、编译器强制处理的契约——只不过可选值表达「没有值」，错误处理表达「为什么没有值」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Swift 的错误是任何遵循 <code>Error</code> 协议的类型，通常用枚举来穷举一组相关失败：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"enum NetworkError: Error {&#10;    case offline&#10;    case timeout(seconds: Int)&#10;    case badStatus(code: Int)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NetworkError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> offline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(seconds: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> badStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(code: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>抛出用 <code>throw</code>，函数签名标 <code>throws</code>，调用处必须 <code>try</code>。错误不像异常那样隐式沿调用栈展开，它在每个 <code>try</code> 处都被编译器看见，无法被无意忽略。这种「显式但不啰嗦」的设计是 Swift 错误模型的精髓。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[调用可能失败的函数] --&gt; B[加 try]&#10;    B --&gt; C{如何处理}&#10;    C --&gt;|do/catch| D[捕获并按类型分支处理]&#10;    C --&gt;|try?| E[失败转成 nil&lt;br/&gt;得到可选值]&#10;    C --&gt;|try!| F[断言不会失败&lt;br/&gt;失败则崩溃]&#10;    D --&gt; G{有 typed throws?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[&quot;throws(MyError)&lt;br/&gt;编译期穷举所有 case&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[&quot;throws&lt;br/&gt;catch 块需兜底 any Error&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; J[defer 注册清理&lt;br/&gt;无论成功失败都执行]\">graph TD\n    A[调用可能失败的函数] --&gt; B[加 try]\n    B --&gt; C{如何处理}\n    C --&gt;|do/catch| D[捕获并按类型分支处理]\n    C --&gt;|try?| E[失败转成 nil&lt;br/&gt;得到可选值]\n    C --&gt;|try!| F[断言不会失败&lt;br/&gt;失败则崩溃]\n    D --&gt; G{有 typed throws?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[\"throws(MyError)&lt;br/&gt;编译期穷举所有 case\"]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[\"throws&lt;br/&gt;catch 块需兜底 any Error\"]\n    A --&gt; J[defer 注册清理&lt;br/&gt;无论成功失败都执行]</pre><p>下表对比四种 try 形态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>写法</th>\n<th>失败时行为</th>\n<th>结果类型</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>try</code> + <code>do/catch</code></td>\n<td>进入 catch 处理</td>\n<td>正常返回值</td>\n<td>需要按错误类型分别处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>try?</code></td>\n<td>表达式求值为 nil</td>\n<td>可选值 <code>T?</code></td>\n<td>不关心具体错误，只要成功值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>try!</code></td>\n<td>运行时崩溃</td>\n<td>正常返回值</td>\n<td>你确定绝不会失败（如读捆绑资源）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>try await</code></td>\n<td>同 try，异步上下文</td>\n<td>正常返回值</td>\n<td>异步函数的错误传播</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"throws-与-do-catch-的传播链\">throws 与 do/catch 的传播链</h2><p><code>throws</code> 会沿调用链向上传播：一个 <code>throws</code> 函数调用另一个 <code>throws</code> 函数时，只需 <code>try</code>，错误自动冒泡给自己的调用方；只有想就地处理时才用 <code>do/catch</code>。这让错误处理可以集中在合适的层级，而不是每一层都强行 try/catch。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func fetchUser() throws -&gt; User {&#10;    let data = try download()        // 错误自动向上传播&#10;    return try decode(data)&#10;}&#10;&#10;do {&#10;    let user = try fetchUser()&#10;    show(user)&#10;} catch NetworkError.offline {&#10;    showOfflineBanner()&#10;} catch NetworkError.timeout(let seconds) {&#10;    retry(after: seconds)            // 模式匹配提取关联值&#10;} catch {&#10;    log(error)                       // error 隐式绑定，兜底 any Error&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> download</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误自动向上传播</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> decode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    show</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NetworkError.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">offline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    showOfflineBanner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NetworkError.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seconds) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: seconds)            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 模式匹配提取关联值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(error)                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// error 隐式绑定，兜底 any Error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>catch</code> 块可以按 case 精确匹配并提取关联值，最后一个无模式的 <code>catch</code> 兜底所有未处理错误。这和<a href=\"../language-core/protocols-generics\">协议与泛型</a>里讲的 <code>any</code> 存在类型相关——传统 <code>throws</code> 抛出的其实是 <code>any Error</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"类型化抛出-让错误进入类型系统\">类型化抛出:让错误进入类型系统</h2><p>传统 <code>throws</code> 有个遗憾：它不告诉你函数会抛什么错，<code>catch</code> 块里只能拿到 <code>any Error</code>，编译器无法帮你穷举。2024 年随 Swift 6 落地的类型化抛出（typed throws，SE-0413）补上了这块——在 <code>throws</code> 后写出具体错误类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func loadConfig() throws(ConfigError) -&gt; Config {&#10;    // 只能抛 ConfigError，编译器强制&#10;}&#10;&#10;do {&#10;    let c = try loadConfig()&#10;} catch {&#10;    // 此处 error 的静态类型就是 ConfigError，可穷举 switch，无需 default&#10;    switch error {&#10;    case .missingKey(let k): print(&quot;缺少 \\(k)&quot;)&#10;    case .malformed: print(&quot;格式错误&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ConfigError) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Config {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 只能抛 ConfigError，编译器强制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> loadConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 此处 error 的静态类型就是 ConfigError，可穷举 switch，无需 default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">missingKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"缺少 </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(k)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .malformed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"格式错误\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>类型化抛出带来两个好处：调用方能在编译期穷举所有失败 case（像处理枚举一样），以及避免 <code>any Error</code> 存在类型的装箱开销——这对<a href=\"../ecosystem-practice/server-swift\">嵌入式 Swift</a> 这类资源受限、不愿引入存在类型运行时的场景尤其重要。官方建议谨慎使用：只在错误集合稳定、且调用方确实需要穷举时才用 typed throws，对外公开 API 通常仍用无类型 <code>throws</code> 以保留演进空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"defer-无论如何都要执行的清理\">defer:无论如何都要执行的清理</h2><p>很多失败场景需要保证资源被清理：打开的文件要关、加的锁要释放、临时状态要回滚。Swift 用 <code>defer</code> 块注册「离开当前作用域时必定执行」的代码，无论是正常返回、抛出错误还是提前 return：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func processFile(at path: String) throws {&#10;    let handle = try FileHandle(forReadingFrom: path)&#10;    defer { handle.closeFile() }     // 离开作用域必执行，即使中途抛错&#10;    let data = try handle.readToEnd()&#10;    try validate(data)               // 即便这里抛错，上面的 defer 仍会关闭文件&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> handle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FileHandle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forReadingFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { handle.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closeFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 离开作用域必执行，即使中途抛错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> handle.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">readToEnd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> validate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data)               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 即便这里抛错，上面的 defer 仍会关闭文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多个 <code>defer</code> 按后进先出（LIFO）顺序执行。<code>defer</code> 把「获取资源」和「释放资源」写在相邻位置，比在每个出口手动清理更不易出错，是错误安全代码的重要工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"result-与错误的两种表示\">Result 与错误的两种表示</h2><p><code>throws</code> 适合同步、就地处理的错误流，但有时你想把「成功或失败」当成一个一等值传递、存储、延后处理——这时用 <code>Result&lt;Success, Failure&gt;</code> 枚举。它在回调式 API、需要把结果塞进数组、或想用函数式手段（<code>map</code>/<code>flatMap</code>）链式变换错误时很有用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let result: Result&lt;User, NetworkError&gt; = .success(user)&#10;let name = result.map(\\.nickname)            // 只在 success 时变换&#10;let user = try result.get()                  // 转回 throws 风格\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result: Result&#x3C;User, NetworkError> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">success</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(\\.nickname)            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只在 success 时变换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 转回 throws 风格</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Result</code> 与 <code>throws</code> 可互转：<code>Result(catching:)</code> 把抛出闭包包成 Result，<code>get()</code> 把 Result 还原成 throws。在 async/await 普及后（见 <a href=\"../concurrency/async-await\">async/await 与结构化并发</a>），异步错误直接用 <code>try await</code> 处理，<code>Result</code> 的回调场景已大幅减少，但它在「把错误当值存储」的场景里仍不可替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Swift 把失败做成显式控制流：<code>Error</code> 协议（常用枚举穷举）+ <code>throw</code>/<code>throws</code>/<code>try</code>/<code>do-catch</code>，每个 <code>try</code> 都被编译器看见，不会被无意忽略。</li>\n<li>错误沿调用链自动向上传播，只在需要就地处理时才 <code>do/catch</code>；<code>catch</code> 可按 case 匹配并提取关联值。</li>\n<li><code>try?</code>（转 nil）、<code>try!</code>（断言不失败）、<code>try</code>（传播）三种形态对应不同确定性。</li>\n<li>类型化抛出（typed throws，SE-0413/Swift 6）把错误类型写进签名，让调用方编译期穷举并避免 <code>any Error</code> 装箱，适合错误集合稳定的场景与<a href=\"../ecosystem-practice/server-swift\">嵌入式</a>环境。</li>\n<li><code>defer</code> 保证作用域退出时的清理必定执行（LIFO），是错误安全的关键工具。</li>\n<li><code>Result</code> 把成功/失败当一等值传递，与 <code>throws</code> 可互转；这套机制与<a href=\"../language-core/types-optionals\">可选值</a>同属「把失败显式化」的哲学。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"错误处理","id":"错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"throws 与 do/catch 的传播链","id":"throws-与-do-catch-的传播链"},{"level":2,"text":"类型化抛出:让错误进入类型系统","id":"类型化抛出-让错误进入类型系统"},{"level":2,"text":"defer:无论如何都要执行的清理","id":"defer-无论如何都要执行的清理"},{"level":2,"text":"Result 与错误的两种表示","id":"result-与错误的两种表示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ARC 与内存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/swift-concurrency/memory-safety/arc-memory"},"next":{"title":"所有权与借用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/swift-concurrency/memory-safety/ownership-borrowing"}}